WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:20.142
Bird was sick.

2
00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:24.685
Her throat was scratchy and her head hurt.

3
00:00:24.686 --> 00:00:28.676
Even her feet ached.

4
00:00:28.677 --> 00:00:38.455
"I feel awful!" moaned Bird.

5
00:00:38.456 --> 00:00:41.640
"Poor Bird," thought Kip.

6
00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:51.920
Kip wanted to help Bird feel better.

7
00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:57.824
"I will bring something to her," he said.

8
00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:03.949
Kip thought about what Bird liked.

9
00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:07.102
Then he had an idea.

10
00:01:07.103 --> 00:01:10.888
"Pizza crust!" said Kip.

11
00:01:10.889 --> 00:01:16.205
"Bird loves pizza crust.

12
00:01:16.206 --> 00:01:28.650
I'll find a good one for Bird."

13
00:01:28.651 --> 00:01:49.474
Kip went to the boardwalk.

14
00:01:49.475 --> 00:02:01.564
He looked in some trash cans.

15
00:02:01.565 --> 00:02:11.814
Soon Kip found a perfect pizza crust.

16
00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:15.572
It had the brown bubbles Bird liked.

17
00:02:15.573 --> 00:02:24.540
"Bird will love this!" Kip said.

18
00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:30.267
On the way home, Kip saw Seagull.

19
00:02:30.268 --> 00:02:34.021
"Hi, Seagull," said Kip.

20
00:02:34.022 --> 00:02:37.924
"Bird is sick.

21
00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:40.887
I'm bringing a pizza crust to her."

22
00:02:40.888 --> 00:02:43.408
Seagull looked at the pizza crust.

23
00:02:43.409 --> 00:02:46.240
"Hmm," said Seagull.

24
00:02:46.241 --> 00:02:51.968
"I don't think that's a good idea."
